      "text": "CHEM TREATMENT"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Chem Screen™ is made up of a screen jacket that is placed over perforated J55 EUE Tubing. It is designed specifically for wells with high lifting cost that have sand failures. The Chem Screen™ runs below the pump intake, in place of the perforated pup joint. This allows sand to be filtered out between the tubing and casing."
